    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u0hz](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u0hz) Magnitude 5.1 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Oct 06 2026 36km NW of Bāgeshwar. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 30.1171 longitude 79.6148. It impacted 535428 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
